            "title": "Truncated Icosahedron",
            "aliases": [
                "Buckyball",
                "Soccer ball polyhedron"
            ],
            "body": "The truncated icosahedron is an Archimedean solid. It has 12 regular pentagonal faces and 20 regular hexagonal faces. The long edge (hexagon-hexagon) measures approximately 1.0 unit while the short edge (hexagon-pentagon) is slightly shorter.",
